  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted ( SB/TG/100/SL/15FA, MS/SB/TG/100/15, GSB/100/2017. Received: 13th June 2017. MS/SB/TG/100/15. Received: 31/07/2017) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - Notwithstanding the details shown on the approved drawings, prior to the commencement of the development, details of the external balcony arrangements shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, demonstrating compliance with the relevant standards of the London Plan Housing SPG, and including details and sections of the finished treatment. The development shall be carried out strictly in accordance with the details so approved and maintained as such thereafter.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to commencement of the development details of storage of cycles shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority , details shall include the provision of independent access to cycle storage spaces for each unit within secure and covered storage close to the entrance to the site. The cycle storage provision shall be implemented in strict accordance with the approved details and retained as such thereafter.",
    "Condition : 5 - Prior to the occupation of the development hereby approved the applicant shall have entered into a formal agreement with the Council to restrict future occupiers of the proposed development from obtaining a permit, with the exception of persons with disabilities, within the Hounslow Town Centre South Controlled Parking Zone.",
    "Condition : 6 - No additional floorspace shall be formed within the residential accommodation hereby permitted by means of internal horizontal division without prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - The parking spaces shown on the proposed plans shall not be used by the occupants (or their visitors) of the hereby approved residential units at any time for the duration of the development."
  ],
